{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1560,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello! This computer movie will\nexplain how to go to space"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4480,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using only the ten hundred words in\nour language that people use the most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9220,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Going to space is hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11260,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First because the Earth\npulls things toward it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13520,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so not only do you have to fight\nthe Earth's pull to get to space,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16460,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you also have to go really fast to the side,\nso that when you fall back toward Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20040,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you miss and go around, instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22380,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how you stay in space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24440,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best way we know of to\nget to space and stay there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is an up-goer that burns fire-water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29540,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually made from all dead animals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31520,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the kind of air that once burned\nthe big sky-bag, and people died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35440,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The burning fire-water hits the\ninside of the up-goer so hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38900,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it pushes the up-goer up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40960,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, it pushes the up-goer\naway from where the fire comes out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44300,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the fire-end points toward space,\nyou are having a bad problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47800,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and will not go to space, today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49660,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are often several fire-water\nburning parts to an up-goer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52860,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that after you use up\nthe fire-water in one part,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55540,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can drop it, and don't have to\nlift it all the way to space too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58700,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Space is cold and has no air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61240,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if you want to go to space and live,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63260,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to be on an up-goer that has a\nroom for people in it, usually on top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67300,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This room has heaters, and air,\nand no holes, so that you can stay alive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71500,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a window, so that you can\nenjoy looking at Earth from space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74620,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It also has a thick side, so that if\nyou want to come back from space,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77860,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you won't burn up from all the\nair you hit on the way down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80660,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hitting air helps slow you down a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82580,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but to help slow down even more,\nthere are big sheets to catch air too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86120,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you don't hit the ground too hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87940,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We humans pretty much always have several\nup-goers almost ready to go to space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92420,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you try to get in one of them,\na lot of people would get really mad at you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95800,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'd get in trouble and probably\ngo into a locked room behind bars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99520,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to use an up-goer to go\nto space instead of into that room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102800,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to have many\nimportant people say \"OK\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105880,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before they say \"OK\", you have to\nprepare to go to space for many years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109420,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to be like many people\nwho went to space in the past,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111780,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should go to school to learn to fly\nsky-boats, and be really good at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115580,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also need to be able to see and hear\nvery well, and not get a sick body or head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119880,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many other things you need to\nbe good at, too, and you need to be lucky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123440,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're good, and lucky,\nand all the important people say \"OK\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127180,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then maybe you can go to space someday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132840,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks for watching. If you like confusing\nstuff explained in simple words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136820,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll probably like the\nbook \"Thing Explainer\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139120,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the man who wrote the picture story,\nXKCD, and the book called \"What if?\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143900,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can find\n\"Thing Explainer\" at book stores,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146380,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or by using your computer to search the\nplace where many computers think together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150120,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or by looking in the words\nbelow this computer movie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153340,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also want to add that I am\na huge fan of XKCD and..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157020,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just super excited to\nbe able to make this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159320,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should definitely check out\n\"Thing Explainer\" if you're into XKCD,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162640,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a great book, it's really fun,\nthe drawings are really fun to pore through,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166460,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Randall's done a great job with it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169860,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's beautiful. And if you like\nthis video, this style of video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173020,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "please, let me know, share,\nI'm excited to see what you think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176100,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
